        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# From CLIP to BLIP-2 — Q-Former as Modality Bridge",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "e095d27738ee7b8a2ef0e4f2a10f98d70ff2b9f29bf01c5252dae71d6e825a1e",
      "target": "`code/main.py` 使用标准库构建一个 Q-Former 风格的交叉注意力模块：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0082",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# From CLIP to BLIP-2 — Q-Former as Modality Bridge",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0083",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# From CLIP to BLIP-2 — Q-Former as Modality Bridge",
