      "ordinal": 42,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# From CLIP to BLIP-2 — Q-Former as Modality Bridge",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 43,
      "source_sha256": "ccf1ed6349c8322a92e5bebf97a999617b4b976eeee86e9c5d4d097bb067646f",
      "target": "所有数学运算都用纯 Python 实现（对向量使用嵌套循环）。虽然是简化示例，但形状正确。程序会打印注意力权重矩阵，便于你查看每个查询从哪些图像块提取了信息。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0086",
