      "ordinal": 47,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0095",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# From CLIP to BLIP-2 — Q-Former as Modality Bridge",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 48,
      "source_sha256": "5e1b3ef66aaf3dc19ab7c8520e91799f07c577f6fd81f6ca1796c82757a8f44f",
      "target": "2. 在 BLIP-2 的阶段 1 中，Q-Former 同时计算三种损失：ITC、ITM、ITG。用伪代码写出每一种损失对应的前向计算签名。哪一种要求启用文本编码器路径？\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0096",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# From CLIP to BLIP-2 — Q-Former as Modality Bridge",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 48,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0097",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# From CLIP to BLIP-2 — Q-Former as Modality Bridge",
