      ],
      "ordinal": 49,
      "source_sha256": "098059ba4e2152c58ca50d05b9620681114a5f17041180c3c1f79e930acfaaa6",
      "target": "3. 比较参数量：Q-Former（12 层，隐藏维度 768）与 2 层 MLP 投影器（1408 → 4096，两层）。LLM 达到多大规模时，188M 参数的 Q-Former 才能通过训练效率的提升抵消自身成本？\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "12-03:b0098",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# From CLIP to BLIP-2 — Q-Former as Modality Bridge",
